    "title": "USPS to launch 14 new sorting and delivery centers through July - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Max Garland ,\n14 hours ago The U.S. Postal Service will open 14 new sorting and delivery centers between May and July, according to agency announcements on April 22 and April 23. The facility openings are happening across 12 states and include locations in Miami and Phoenix. The agency said the launches will not spark Post Office closures or change local Post Office retail and PO Box delivery services. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
